msgid "⟪k:0⟫I ⟪k:1⟫accomplished⟪k:2⟫ something."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J’ai ⟪k:1⟫accompli⟪k:2⟫ quelque chose."

#: scenario8:scenario8_9C6ECEBE_D077_4098_BD2B_1FA6B64D6C53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a774dec55f583f5e5845cb2db2365279666ad1f6e90555eb46a9aa1debe3298f
#. default-sha256: d75627b36ce7947cc5dee45540823fdb5fdfcc2977429eb2128ab8f1f80563bc
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9C6ECEBE_D077_4098_BD2B_1FA6B64D6C53"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The sum of everything I did these three days..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La somme de tout ce que j’ai fait ces trois derniers jours..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CB3C7978_9C00_4437_A359_E6D28E83A517
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84a77a7c9d515c4c28738610a4bedd3fc4a4eb157a1e7e25d4e85d8dd7dcc350
#. default-sha256: c07692ec1fcbc0c436d603e011083d4faa10482cdf0d6cb0da256693dcd58f77
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CB3C7978_9C00_4437_A359_E6D28E83A517"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫should⟪k:2⟫ be enough to change her heart..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...⟪k:1⟫devrait⟪k:2⟫ suffire à changer son cœur..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_856665BF_C630_4CA9_AE54_B340A95F78B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 186863eaa5bb87b93f8713bcdcac7fd1fe1abc10aecdb12258942de1f5ef673d
#. default-sha256: 292cdfabc082b8d729b768ffff903ec00ba9c8d582fd80f344ab7d8bfe45bd0f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_856665BF_C630_4CA9_AE54_B340A95F78B2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and change the course of their next lives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...et le cours de leur prochaine vie."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F92CB0CC_84A8_4080_A3E0_B5194806340E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c29bb500e20f45d7f77276982597feecf302691fb9cfe351ad7f813dac36394b
#. default-sha256: 3566149cd98b62ceba057762a6284929fb7f7443b64338e177e126deca9731e1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F92CB0CC_84A8_4080_A3E0_B5194806340E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They should be able to avoid the tragedies I witnessed through each of their doors."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ils devraient pouvoir éviter les tragédies auxquelles j’ai assisté derrière chacune des "
"portes."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F93A566A_BD29_44BD_BE2A_8ED6A23FA60F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66493f2e48596a24562495db07f093cf95d0b0280da1bd2605cb2a3658bd7db4
#. default-sha256: 95ca16d79eb3b37417d11f6439171411463d7bf80bae19472c96ea24641edd8b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F93A566A_BD29_44BD_BE2A_8ED6A23FA60F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫When we step through this door and people see Morgana’s body,⟪k:5⟫we’ll "
"be made to pay for our sins."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Quand nous franchirons cette porte et que les gens verront le corps de "
"Morgana, ils vont vouloir qu’on paye pour nos péchés."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4E429D64_4256_4431_AEE5_082107636ABC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f64481e176d9b68d6e1483d5423ba7c8bd23ad6ae74a9f5666ede56859f0e5f7
#. default-sha256: f6930289a34e618080a0d46deae6014d8dbbb92e5164d92044fabb0424a12315
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4E429D64_4256_4431_AEE5_082107636ABC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ultimately, I’m the one responsible,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫so the two of you are welcome to "
"stay behind..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Au bout du compte, je suis le seul responsable,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫donc si vous voulez "
"rester ici tous les deux..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A6C300C5_C8C4_4A4F_95DA_668A7568FA32
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8bffac22475b1012fe0f929c803404e9503c14285f7fd838f1e92598c264ea3
#. default-sha256: b3540ce0ec413ae932de2534ecbd46337f327e22fbfa8a2b0edc160f0c52e4df
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A6C300C5_C8C4_4A4F_95DA_668A7568FA32"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m coming with you.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫A girl died because of the things I did...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"I can’t just pretend it didn’t have anything to do with me..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je viens avec vous.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Une fille est morte à cause de mes actes...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"Je ne peux pas simplement fermer les yeux et prétendre que je n’ai eu aucun rôle à jouer..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_3D6F1818_603A_4F36_83E6_C18293AF930E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fdd5ae4603d14c2b7cc62f61843484fd4adbe02e93263173af61cb03712153a6
#. default-sha256: 9edbc6d77debf650b86eb0280e497ba197d11689ce7702df3e70424767fe99ca
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3D6F1818_603A_4F36_83E6_C18293AF930E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No, I don’t ⟪k:2⟫want⟪k:3⟫ to."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Non, je ne ⟪k:2⟫veux⟪k:3⟫ pas."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0EC45386_CC26_4273_9642_877D8503B806
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 146efe263f3c2a46098b703a16ceed55a0a067037ef0208ddbbdedde2a41d5dc
#. default-sha256: f2ba845373409fe367fae4688c7048309085479f909e19e7c184943bc56ee0cd
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0EC45386_CC26_4273_9642_877D8503B806"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I never had any intention of fleeing.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You may have been the one running "
"the operation,⟪k:5⟫but I did just as many terrible things as you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je n’ai jamais eu l’intention de fuir.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫C’est vrai, c’est vous qui avez "
"dirigé l’opération,⟪k:5⟫mais j’ai commis des actes tout aussi horribles que vous."

