msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0357EF2B_3EF5_4C3A_BAC0_D828E0C3AB1A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I figure this is probably my last chance to say it,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫so... ⟪k:5⟫thank you "
"for convincing me to hand over my key."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Je pense que ce sera peut-être ma dernière chance de vous le dire,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"alors... ⟪k:5⟫merci de m’avoir convaincu de vous remettre ma clef."

#: scenario8:scenario8_FF87DF36_1317_4F06_B292_9C10C06315C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e433beaf3f33c0e0393fb6371bd9adcf658e2439f97fc5c3c92fe325381f943a
#. default-sha256: eeb2a3052ba13a35950a9cbe12eb72983a1209c3500f06cf32b0250adaf1966a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FF87DF36_1317_4F06_B292_9C10C06315C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫For giving me the courage to open my eyes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫De m’avoir donné le courage d’ouvrir les yeux."

#: scenario8:scenario8_00F54393_691B_4C8B_9333_2734C66DD262
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc5e10f5feb642b3e80e2b39cffb060bd36c1c436a030cc12ac18b778fd0ffac
#. default-sha256: d7fb0028a838e761801a660c7af3510e93731957d07d25283536100a934a3663
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_00F54393_691B_4C8B_9333_2734C66DD262"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You always had the courage within you, Mell.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You simply needed a "
"little help finding it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Tu as toujours eu ce courage en toi, Mell.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Tu avais simplement "
"besoin d’un peu d’aide pour le trouver."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8083C7A0_A13C_418B_BA18_0C5A13DB5AA0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd73d2e9d5552d12c27a854d1f0423497848d377bcef1840b1a8322442b17b63
#. default-sha256: 93f32f79147ded2a4a88d240fa1c70f84297fed22590053b7546e181d4a288db
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8083C7A0_A13C_418B_BA18_0C5A13DB5AA0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It wasn’t my strength that allowed you to take action,⟪k:1⟫but your own."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ce n’est pas ma résolution qui t’a permis d’agir,⟪k:1⟫mais la tienne."

#: scenario8:scenario8_473582DE_B5DC_4205_8803_8FB0FCD38B8E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c9385dcb9172b09abe55cbaaea69285d904cb78b1783a0b472a6f3b072fa853
#. default-sha256: 13024d6d268cc6fb56e40d592d6f74d3b8c59237a09506fdcaae794cd907be9b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_473582DE_B5DC_4205_8803_8FB0FCD38B8E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Haha... ⟪k:3⟫you sure know how to make someone feel better about themselves."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Haha... ⟪k:3⟫vous êtes doué pour remonter le moral des gens, ça c’est sûr."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6EFABDF9_3EF4_4C50_B705_EB34C7E70B7D
